The `countdown` subscription procedure has been added to `/home/user/project/server.ts`. Here's what was implemented:

```ts
countdown: publicProcedure.subscription(async function* () {
  yield 3;
  await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 100));
  yield 2;
  await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 100));
  yield 1;
